---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import CTA from "../components/CTA.astro";
const updated = "2026-06-05";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="KMail's privacy commitments: no ads, no scanning your mail for marketing, your data is never sold or used to train models."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
      <h1>Your mail is yours</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        We make money from subscriptions, not from your data. KMail does not show
        ads, does not scan your mail for advertising, and never sells your data or
        uses it to train AI models.
      </p>
      <p class="muted">Last updated: {updated}</p>

      <h2>Our commitments</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>No ads, ever.</strong> Your inbox is a tool, not a billboard.</li>
        <li><strong>No content scanning for marketing.</strong> Automated processing exists only to deliver mail, filter spam, and provide features you turn on.</li>
        <li><strong>No data sales.</strong> We never sell or rent your personal data.</li>
        <li><strong>No model training on your content.</strong> Your mail, calendars, and contacts are not used to train machine-learning models.</li>
        <li><strong>You can leave.</strong> Export everything at any time; we cryptographically delete data after the cancellation grace period.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        To run the service we process your account details (email, organization,
        billing), the mail and calendar data you store, and operational metadata
        such as logs and aggregate availability metrics. We minimize retention and
        scope every record to your tenant.
      </p>

      <h2>Sub-processors</h2>
      <p>
        We use a small set of infrastructure and payment providers (for example,
        a payment processor for billing). A current list of sub-processors is
        available on request and updated before any material change.
      </p>

      <h2>Data residency &amp; your rights</h2>
      <p>
        EU data-residency options are available. You can access, export, correct,
        or delete your data. To exercise these rights or ask a privacy question,
        contact <a href="mailto:privacy@kmail.kchat.dev">privacy@kmail.kchat.dev</a>.
      </p>

      <p class="muted">
        This page summarizes our approach to privacy and is not a substitute for
        the full Data Processing Agreement available to customers.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTA />
</BaseLayout>
